<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Lucas De Groot on Typophile Archive</title><link>http://typophile-archive.simon-cozens.org/tags/lucas-de-groot/</link><description>Recent content in Lucas De Groot on Typophile Archive</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 29 Dec 2007 03:41:00 +0100</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="http://typophile-archive.simon-cozens.org/tags/lucas-de-groot/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Luc(as) de Groot</title><link>http://typophile-archive.simon-cozens.org/40415/</link><pubDate>Sat, 29 Dec 2007 03:41:00 +0100</pubDate><guid>http://typophile-archive.simon-cozens.org/40415/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20141116092431/http:/typophile.com/wiki/Indices"&gt;Indices&lt;/a&gt; : &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20141116092431/http:/typophile.com/wiki/Designers"&gt;Designers&lt;/a&gt; : Luc(as) de Groot&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lucas de Groot (b. 21 June 1963 in Noordwijkerhout, the Netherlands) is a well-known Dutch type designer, the head of the type foundry Fontfabrik (AKA &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20141116092431/http:/typophile.com/wiki/LucasFonts"&gt;LucasFonts&lt;/a&gt;). De Groot is mainly known for the large font family or system, &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20141116092431/http:/typophile.com/wiki/Thesis"&gt;Thesis&lt;/a&gt;, consisting of &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20141116092431/http:/typophile.com/wiki/TheSans"&gt;TheSans&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20141116092431/http:/typophile.com/wiki/TheSerif"&gt;TheSerif&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20141116092431/http:/typophile.com/wiki/TheMix"&gt;TheMix&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20141116092431/http:/typophile.com/wiki/TheSansMono"&gt;TheSansMono&lt;/a&gt; and later &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20141116092431/http:/typophile.com/wiki/TheAntiqua"&gt;TheAntiqua&lt;/a&gt;. Also &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20141116092431/http:/typophile.com/wiki/Corpid"&gt;Corpid&lt;/a&gt; (previously AgroSans).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Luc also designed custom fonts such as &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20141116092431/http:/typophile.com/wiki/Calibri"&gt;Calibri&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20141116092431/http:/typophile.com/wiki/Consolas"&gt;Consolas&lt;/a&gt; for Microsoft Vista, for the newspapers like Der Spiegel with ‘SpiegelSans’, Die tageszeitung with ‘Taz’, Folha de S. Paulo with ‘FolhaSerif’, and Sun Microsystems corporation with ‘SunSans’.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>